</h2>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"hidden max-w-xs text-right text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-500 md:block\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-2\" data-name=\"header description\">\n                Real people, real dealers, and the small moments that make a hand worth remembering.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\" data-kid=\"1-8-2\" data-name=\"benefits cards grid\">\n            <article class=\"value-card relative min-h-[220px] rounded-[24px] border border-white/10 bg-[#101821]/80 p-6 shadow-[0_22px_55px_rgba(0,0,0,.22)]\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-1\" data-name=\"live dealers feature card\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-[24px] border border-[#FFD700]/0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_20%_0%,rgba(255,215,0,.11),transparent_46%)]\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-1-1\" data-name=\"feature card background gradient\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative flex h-full flex-col justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-1-2\" data-name=\"feature card inner container\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-8-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"feature icon container\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-9 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-[#FFD700]/30 bg-[#FFD700]/10 text-lg text-[#FFD700]\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"feature icon\">\n                            ✦\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"display-font text-xl font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"feature card title\">\n                            Live Dealers\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[270px] text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"feature card description\">\n                            Professionally hosted streams — feel the casino vibe from home.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mono-font mt-8 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[#FFD700]/75\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"feature card footer tag\">\n                        Feel the room\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"value-card relative min-h-[220px] rounded-[24px] border border-white/10 bg-[#101821]/80 p-6 shadow-[0_22px_55px_rgba(0,0,0,.22)]\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-2\" data-name=\"instant seats feature card\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-[24px] border border-[#FFD700]/0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_80%_0%,rgba(255,215,0,.1),transparent_46%)]\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-2-1\" data-name=\"feature card background gradient\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative flex h-full flex-col justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-2-2\" data-name=\"feature card inner container\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-8-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"feature icon container\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-9 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-[#FFD700]/30 bg-[#FFD700]/10 text-lg text-[#FFD700]\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"feature icon\">\n                            ↗\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"display-font text-xl font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"feature card title\">\n                            Instant Seats\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[270px] text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"feature card description\">\n                            Jump into active tables with one click. No downloads.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mono-font mt-8 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[#FFD700]/75\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"feature card footer tag\">\n                        Find your pace\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"value-card relative min-h-[220px] rounded-[24px] border border-white/10 bg-[#101821]/80 p-6 shadow-[0_22px_55px_rgba(0,0,0,.22)]\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-3\" data-name=\"real decks feature card\" data-reveal=\"\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-[24px] border border-[#FFD700]/0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_0%,rgba(255,215,0,.1),transparent_46%)]\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-3-1\" data-name=\"feature card background gradient\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative flex h-full flex-col justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-3-2\" data-name=\"feature card inner container\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-8-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"feature icon container\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-9 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-[#FFD700]/30 bg-[#FFD700]/10 text-lg text-[#FFD700]\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"feature icon\">\n                            ♢\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"display-font text-xl font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"feature card title\">\n                            Real Decks\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[270px] text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-3-2-1-3\" data-name=\"feature card description\">\n                            Every card is dealt from a real deck by a live dealer on camera — no RNG, no scripts.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mono-font mt-8 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[#FFD700]/75\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"feature card footer tag\">\n                        Watch it happen\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"relative z-20 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-36 pt-8\" data-kid=\"1-9\" da