"1-9-2-2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"title\">\n                                Play Live\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[430px] text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-1-1-3\" data-name=\"description\">\n                                Chat, bet, and enjoy the show with live dealers. The table is yours, the room is real.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"mono-font rounded-full border border-rose-300/20 bg-rose-300/8 px-3 py-2 text-[10px] text-rose-200\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"status tag\">\n                            DEALING\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-[1.18fr_.82fr]\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"panel content\">\n                        <div class=\"relative min-h-[360px] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[#FFD700]/20 bg-[#07110e] p-5 shadow-[0_18px_45px_rgba(0,0,0,.35)]\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"live game viewer\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-x-5 top-5 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"header info\">\n                                <span class=\"mono-font text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-emerald-300\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"table status text\">\n                                    Table 07 · live dealer\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] text-zinc-500\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"timer status\">\n                                    <span class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-300\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"timer dot\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    00:42\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-[49%] flex w-[76%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-[50%] border border-[#d4af37]/45 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,rgba(23,86,51,.95),rgba(5,30,20,.98))] px-7 py-14 shadow-[inset_0_0_50px_rgba(0,0,0,.4),0_0_35px_rgba(212,175,55,.08)]\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"game board\">\n                                <span class=\"absolute left-4 top-5 mono-font text-[8px] uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-[#d4af37]/75\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"branding text\">\n                                    HuffleShuffle\n                                </span>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-end gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"cards display\">\n                                    <img alt=\"Gold Ace of Hearts on the live table\" class=\"h-28 w-[76px] -rotate-6 rounded-xl object-cover shadow-[0_12px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,.4)]\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"card image 1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/AceHeart.png\"/>\n                                    <img alt=\"Gold Ace of Spades on the live table\" class=\"h-28 w-[76px] rotate-6 rounded-xl object-cover shadow-[0_12px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,.4)]\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"card image 2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/AceSpade.png\"/>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 rounded-full border border-[#FFD700]/35 bg-[#FFD700]/10 px-3 py-1 text-[9px] text-[#FFD700]\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"pot display\">\n                                    POT $420\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"chat-bubble absolute bottom-6 left-5 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/8 px-3 py-2 text-[10px] text-zinc-300\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-1-3\" data-name=\"chat bubble 1\" data-reason=\"animated pop-in effect\" style=\"animation-delay:-.8s\">\n                                Nice hand, Sam.\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"chat-bubble absolute right-5 top-20 rounded-xl border border-[#FFD700]/25 bg-[#FFD700]/10 px-3 py-2 text-[10px] text-[#f2c14e]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-1-4\" data-name=\"chat bubble 2\" data-reason=\"animated pop-in effect\" style=\"animation-delay:-2.8s\">\n                                Dealer: your action\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0b0f14]/80 p-5 shadow-[0_18px_45px_rgba(0,0,0,.24)]\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"table status card\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-4\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"header row\">\n                                <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"label\">\n                                    At the table\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"mono-font text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-zinc-600\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"seated count\">\n                                    6 / 6 seated\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"space-y-3 pt-5\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"player list\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-4-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"player 1 row\">\n                                    <span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#FFD700] text-[10px] font-black text-[#11130f]\" data